title: Next and Previous result go through the hits of the Search panel (the canvas flies to each), the list shows as a tree or as one list, and an empty query clears the results
folders: git-history
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: script: no search option
expect-log: search 'fn': \d+ hits

wait 3000
search fn
wait 1500
search-option next
wait 1500
mark first-hit
wait 450
search-option next
wait 1500
mark second-hit
wait 450
search-option previous
wait 1500
mark back-to-first
wait 450
search-option list on
wait 800
mark as-a-list
wait 450
search-option list off
wait 800
mark as-a-tree
wait 450
search
wait 1000
mark cleared
wait 450
quit
